        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 19440,
            "text": "Good morning, appreciate you joining on short notice."
          },
          {
            "start": 19441,
            "end": 25920,
            "text": "Hey, thanks for sticking with this time slot."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-06",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 45360,
            "end": 97200,
            "text": "Hey there, thanks for making time for this."
          },
          {
            "start": 97201,
            "end": 110160,
            "text": "Hey, thanks for carving out time today."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 116640,
            "end": 168480,
            "text": "Let's get into it, what would you like to start with?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-06",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 174960,
            "end": 181440,
            "text": "We are doing fine day to day, a couple of specific things came up though."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 194400,
            "end": 246240,
            "text": "Glad to make time for this, let's walk through the list."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-06",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 252720,
            "end": 259200,
            "text": "Our year end donor report stops short of the full list once it gets past a few thousand rows, so we are stitching multiple exports together by hand."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-06",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 272160,
            "end": 330480,
            "text": "Our year end donor report stops at about 3,200 rows even though we have close to 5,000 donors on file."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 343440,
            "end": 369360,
            "text": "That helps a lot, I have one clarifying question."
          },
          {
            "start": 369361,
            "end": 382320,
            "text": "Which specific report is that, and do you know roughly what row count it stops at?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-06",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 401760,
            "end": 440640,
            "text": "It is the year end donor summary report, and it consistently cuts off near 3,200 rows."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 453600,
            "end": 466560,
            "text": "Good to have that squared away, what else is going on for you all?"
